# 23. Error Handling

The application should handle:

### Invalid input

```text
Please enter a valid question.
```

### Gemini service failure

```text
EduGenie could not reach the AI service.
Please try again.
```

### Network failure

```text
Connection problem detected.
Please check your internet connection.
```

### Invalid generated data

The backend should validate structured Gemini output before displaying or storing it.

