* Quiz scoring
* Prompt construction
* Data validation
* Recommendation logic

## Integration Testing

Test:

```text
Frontend → Backend → Gemini
Frontend → Backend → Database
```

## UI Testing

Test:

* Forms
* Navigation
* Buttons
* Chat
* Quiz
* Responsive design

## AI Testing

Test:

* Different subjects
* Different difficulty levels
* Different question types
* Follow-up questions
* Ambiguous questions
* Incorrect assumptions
* Unsafe or inappropriate prompts
* API failures

